note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note omegallm adam.om (aien-train#52): init, global-norm clip, Adam with bias correction, the LR
note schedule, gradient blocks (CONTRACT-V1 section 5) and one training step (CONTRACT section 5).
note Needs math.om, data.om, model.om.
note Exact operation order (agreed with the oracle lane, recorded in CONTRACT section 5):
note   n = sqrt(sum_i g_i^2) (i ascending); if n > 1: c = 1/n, g_i = g_i c.
note   b^(s+1) by s+1 repeated multiplications starting from 1.0; bc = 1 - b^(s+1).
note   m = 0.9 m + (1.0 - 0.9) g; v = 0.99 v + (1.0 - 0.99)(g g);
note   p = p - (lr_s (m/bc1)) / (sqrt(v/bc2) + 1e-8).
note   lr_s = (lr (s+1))/100 for s < 100, else lr (1 - (0.9 (s-100))/max(1, TOTAL-100)).

note Mutant c (bias correction removed): 1 in the product, 0 in the mutant.
const OMUTC ulong 1

note Mutant d (gradient blocks combined in reverse order, G-1 first): 1 in the product, 0 in the
note mutant.
const OMUTD ulong 1

note per-sequence losses of the current batch
global olos f64 64

note init (CONTRACT section 5): r_i = (splitmix64(S+i) >> 11) 2^-53 (N[2^-53] ->
note 1.1102230246251565*^-16); w = (2 r - 1) 0.034641016151377546 (N[0.02 Sqrt[3]]); wo and w2
note times 1/sqrt(2L); gains 1; m = v = 0.
fn oinit to void
p = get og 8
sd = get og 40
for q ulong ocn p
i = mul q OCH
ie = oce q p
while lt i ie bound 999999
r = mul f64 shr smx add sd i 11 1.1102230246251565e-16
owp i mul sub add r r 1.0 0.034641016151377546
i = add i 1
end
end
d = get og 2
ri = div 1.0f64 fsqrt f64 mul 2 get og 5
for l ulong get og 5
oiset opg1 l d 1.0
oiset opg2 l d 1.0
oiscale opwo l mul d d ri
oiscale opw2 l mul d get og 4 ri
end
oiset get og 33 d 1.0
ozerom mul 2 p
end

fn ozerom n ulong to void
for q ulong ocn n
i = mul q OCH
ie = oce q n
while lt i ie bound 999999
omvp i 0.0f64
i = add i 1
end
end
end

fn oiset o ulong n ulong v f64 to void
for i ulong n
owp add o i v
end
end

fn oiscale o ulong n ulong v f64 to void
for i ulong n
owp add o i mul owg add o i v
end
end

fn olrs s ulong lr f64 to f64
if lt s 100
ret div mul lr f64 add s 1 100.0
end
den = ulong 1
if gt get og 42 101
den = sub get og 42 100
end
ret mul lr sub 1.0 div mul 0.9 f64 sub s 100 f64 den
end

fn opowb b f64 s ulong to f64
pw = 1.0f64
for i ulong add s 1
pw = mul pw b
end
ret pw
end

note clip the gradient to global norm 1 and apply one Adam update at step og[41]
fn oadam to void
p = get og 8
ss = 0.0f64
for q ulong ocn p
i = mul q OCH
ie = oce q p
while lt i ie bound 999999
g = ocsg i
ss = add ss mul g g
i = add i 1
end
end
nr = fsqrt ss
if gt nr 1.0
oclip div 1.0 nr
end
s = get og 41
lrs = olrs s bitcast f64 get og 43
bc1 = sub 1.0 opowb 0.9 s
bc2 = sub 1.0 opowb 0.99 s
if eq OMUTC 0
bc1 = 1.0f64
bc2 = 1.0f64
end
put ofs 3 lrs
put ofs 4 bc1
put ofs 5 bc2
for q2 ulong ocn p
k = mul q2 OCH
ke = oce q2 p
while lt k ke bound 999999
oadam1 k
k = add k 1
end
end
end

note g_i = g_i c for i < P
fn oclip c f64 to void
p = get og 8
for q ulong ocn p
j = mul q OCH
je = oce q p
while lt j je bound 999999
ocsp j mul ocsg j c
j = add j 1
end
end
end

note moments of parameter i: m = 0.9 m + (1 - 0.9) g; v = 0.99 v + (1 - 0.99) g^2
fn oadam1 i ulong to void
g = ogrg add get og 10 i
mo = add get og 11 i
m = omvg mo
m = mul 0.9 m
a = sub 1.0f64 0.9
m = add m mul a g
omvp mo m
vo = add get og 12 i
v = omvg vo
v = mul 0.99 v
a = sub 1.0f64 0.99
v = add v mul a mul g g
omvp vo v
oadam2 i m v
end

note p[i] -= lr (m/bc1) / (sqrt(v/bc2) + 1e-8) with lr, bc1, bc2 in ofs 3, 4, 5
fn oadam2 i ulong m f64 v f64 to void
u = div m get ofs 4
u = mul get ofs 3 u
w = div v get ofs 5
w = add fsqrt w 0.00000001
u = div u w
w = owg i
owp i sub w u
end

note one training step at step og[41] on TRAIN; returns the batch loss at the pre-update
note parameters and increments the step. ogradw (lio.om, eio.om) runs the K workers.
fn ostep to f64
s = get og 41
obatch s
ls = ogradw
oadam
put og 41 add s 1
ret ls
end

note gradient of the step loss for the batch in obx/oby (no clip, no update); returns the loss.
note CONTRACT-V1 section 5: G = og[44] blocks of R = B/G sequences; block j is accumulated from
note zero for b ascending; GRD = block 0, then GRD[i] = GRD[i] + block j[i] for j ascending.
note G = 1 is the v0 gradient bit for bit. Every block is accumulated in BLK (CONTRACT-V3 section 2)
note and block 0 copied into GRD, the same bits as accumulating it in GRD.
fn ograd to f64
gg = get og 44
for i ulong gg
j = i
if eq OMUTD 0
j = sub sub gg 1 i
end
oblkc j
ogfold eq i 0
end
ret olsum
end

note block j into BLK (gradient pool [P, 2P), zeroed first); losses into olos
fn oblkc j ulong to void
p = get og 8
put og 10 p
ozerog p p
bb = get og 6
sc = div 1.0f64 f64 mul get og 1 bb
r = div bb get og 44
b = mul j r
for i ulong r
put olos b ofwd b
obwd b sc
b = add b 1
end
put og 10 0
end

note BLK into GRD: copied for the first block, else GRD[i] = GRD[i] + BLK[i] (ogadd)
fn ogfold first bool to void
if not first
ogadd
ret
end
p = get og 8
for q ulong ocn p
i = mul q OCH
ie = oce q p
while lt i ie bound 999999
ocsp i ogrg add p i
i = add i 1
end
end
end

note GRD[i] = GRD[i] + BLK[i] for i ascending
fn ogadd to void
p = get og 8
for q ulong ocn p
i = mul q OCH
ie = oce q p
while lt i ie bound 999999
ogadd1 i p
i = add i 1
end
end
end

note GRD[i] += BLK[i] (BLK at P)
fn ogadd1 i ulong p ulong to void
x = ogrg add p i
ocsp i add ocsg i x
end

note step loss: sum of olos[b] for b ascending from 0.0, divided by f64 B
fn olsum to f64
ls = 0.0f64
bb = get og 6
for b ulong bb
ls = add ls get olos b
end
ret div ls f64 bb
end

note adamck: Adam self-check on the small shape. With a constant gradient g from zero moments,
note exact arithmetic gives m/bc1 = g and v/bc2 = g^2 at every step, so after K steps
note p = -sum_s lr_s g/(|g| + 1e-8). Prints `A K maxrel_bits_hex maxrel_e15` and exits 41 when
note maxrel > 1e-12. Without bias correction (mutant c) the step-1 ratio is exactly 1 and the step-2
note ratio is 1.347; the query and the predicted 0.63909 are in docs/omegallm/README.md, "Sizing".
fn cmdadamck to void
put og 0 256
put og 1 8
put og 2 16
put og 3 2
put og 4 32
put og 5 2
put og 6 2
if not ogeom
exit 12
end
put og 42 200
put og 43 bitcast ulong 0.001f64
put og 41 0
p = get og 8
for i ulong p
x = sub f64 rem i 7 3.0
x = mul x 0.0001
ogrp add get og 10 i x
end
for k ulong 5
oadam
put og 41 add get og 41 1
end
mx = 0.0f64
for j ulong p
mx = fmax mx oadamex j
end
oputc 65
oputc 32
oputu 5
oputc 32
oputx bitcast ulong mx
oputc 32
oputl long mul mx 1000000000000000.0
oputc 10
oflush
if gt mx 0.000000000001
exit 41
end
end

fn oadamex j ulong to f64
g = ogrg add get og 10 j
w = 0.0f64
for s ulong 5
w = sub w div mul olrs s bitcast f64 get og 43 g add fabs g 0.00000001
end
d = fabs sub owg j w
if eq w 0.0
ret d
end
ret div d fabs w
end
